      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In my opinion, for this situation it would probably be best to figure out and add new VRC+ benefits, give everyone an icon, but make it tied to your Trusted status to prevent new accounts from using inappropriate images. Then let everyone that has paid for VRC+ before the change keep the feature regardless of trust level.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-12-05T22:25:43.627Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like to preface that I am, and going to remain, a VRC+ Subscriber. But my biggest quarrel with the current set up is the new icons. Ive uploaded a good amount of icons now, and am having lots of fun with them. I think it is a great feature! But I honestly feel like this is unfair for people who don't subscribe (which is a good chunk of my friends). \nYes its great to have an icon above my head- But the issue is that i don't see it, others do. And as someone who doesn't have friends who are willing/able to subscribe, I am basically in a sea of abbreviated name circles. So weirdly, i feel like i have a disadvantage for paying. \nIf all vrchat users were able to upload a single icon to use, this would, in my mind, make the \"icons only\" mode way better; This UI decision was a great one btw, super clean!; It would allow everyone to be easily identified, and would remove my odd one out feeling i get when im the only one with an icon above me.\nIf its cost of hosting the images is the issue, I would happily take a cut from the number of icons i can upload so that, lets say 32, other people can upload their own one. I may be alone with that feeling, but I benefit from it just as much as anyone else would, because of the above. \nAnd if you are worried about this lowering the value of the subscription, frankly I want to support this game so that it gets better for everyone- not just for me, so I dont really mind if this would \"lessen\" the value, I'm here to support you guys build something i love. BUT you could add in other customization, for example, Custom nameplate colors or names, Changing the color of the Rings around nameplate/Icon when speaking, GIF icons, looping through a group of uploaded icons. There's heaps of ways you can improve the value without intentionally blocking features.\nI really hope that you take this into consideration, because the lack of people who have icons does make me feel like a bit of a \"shill\" and I have been called as such on a few occasions at this point lol, and I can understand where they are coming from",
